2026-07-27T14:53:00.9033851Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T14:53:00.9034361Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:53:00.9035494Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:53:00.9036066Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
